warning[mixed_case_hex_literals]: `0xFFfF` mixes upper and lower case digits
  --> tests/lint/mixed_case_hex_literals/example.jai:4:13
   |
 4 |     mask := 0xFFfF;
   |             ^^^^^^
   |
help: write `0xFFFF`
   |
 4 ~     mask := 0xFFFF;
   |
   = note: `mixed_case_hex_literals` is `warn` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/mixed_case_hex_literals
